{"id":"0f042b9b36348cbc","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Bounding Number","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number — ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Bounding Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number — ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Bounding Number","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-bounding-number — ZFC Pcf3 Eventual Bounding Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\mathfrak b\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\mathfrak b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod A\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\\}\">\\(\\prod A\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\)</span> is the set-ideal predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> are cardinality notions (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_J\">\\(\\leq_J\\)</span> is eventual domination modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>, defined here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualBoundingNumber}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualBoundingNumber}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}domination}\\vdash f\\leq_Jg\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\prod A\\land\\{a\\in A:f(a)&gt;g(a)\\}\\in J\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}domination}\\vdash f\\leq_Jg\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\prod A\\land\\{a\\in A:f(a)&gt;g(a)\\}\\in J\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualBoundingNumber}_S(A,J,\\mathfrak b)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak b)\\land\\mathfrak b=\\min\\{\\kappa\\in V:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\prod A\\;(\\mathcal F\\approx\\kappa\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod A\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\neg(f\\leq_Jg))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualBoundingNumber}_S(A,J,\\mathfrak b)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak b)\\land\\mathfrak b=\\min\\{\\kappa\\in V:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\prod A\\;(\\mathcal F\\approx\\kappa\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod A\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\neg(f\\leq_Jg))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","he